We may accept the following as evidence of U.S. citizenship :
    Certificate of Citizenship N-560/N-561 ;
    Certificate of Naturalization N-550/N-570 ;
      Machine Readable Immigrant Visa MRIV showing a category code of IR3 or IH3 ; [26] or
   U.S. passport .

